`--verification-cache` is no longer silently bypassed in two setups. A self-contained build, such as this fork's release archives, has no `host/fxr` directory; its host is now identified by the `libhostfxr` and `libhostpolicy` it bundles, so the cache key still changes whenever the runtime or the host changes. And each request of `--filter-position-batch` now reads and writes the cache as a separate `--filter-position` run does, including a repeated request in the same batch. Without `--verification-cache` nothing changes. See https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/387.
